---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy notice"
  description="How this site handles enquiry data, technical records and future analytics choices."
  path="/privacy/"
  updated="24 Aug 2026"
>
  <h2>Scope of this notice</h2>
  <p>
    This notice covers the public DataDecision website and its diagnostic enquiry form. Client
    project data is handled under the terms agreed for that engagement.
  </p>

  <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
  <p>
    The enquiry form asks for your name, work email, company or website, role, primary problem,
    preferred timeline, optional project-budget band and consent to a response. Hidden fields may
    capture campaign parameters and the referring page so the enquiry source can be understood.
  </p>
  <p>
    The form uses automated-spam checks, including a hidden field and a minimum completion time.
  </p>

  <h2>Form delivery</h2>
  <p>
    When you submit the enquiry form, the entered information and ordinary request metadata are
    processed by a form-delivery service and forwarded to DataDecision by email. You can email
    DataDecision directly instead of using the form.
  </p>

  <h2>Purposes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Review and respond to a requested diagnostic or partnership enquiry.</li><li>
      Assess fit and prepare a written scope.
    </li><li>Protect the form and diagnose delivery failures.</li><li>
      Understand aggregate enquiry sources after an approved analytics setup exists.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Retention and recipients</h2>
  <p>
    The form-delivery service processes the submission so it can reach DataDecision. DataDecision
    keeps the resulting enquiry record only as long as needed to respond, assess fit, meet
    applicable obligations and maintain necessary business records.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The site currently uses no third-party analytics or non-essential cookies. Interaction events
    used by the interface remain in the page and are not sent to an analytics service. See the <a
      href="/cookies/">cookie policy</a
    >.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    To ask about information supplied through this site, email <a
      href="mailto:contact@datadecision.consulting">contact@datadecision.consulting</a
    >. You may ask DataDecision to correct or delete enquiry information, subject to any record that
    must be retained for an applicable obligation.
  </p>

  <h2>Security and limits</h2>
  <p>
    DataDecision limits the information requested and uses a specialist delivery service for the
    enquiry form. No website or email workflow can promise absolute security.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
